# Mocks generator

`scripts/generate_from_mocks.py` + `support/Mocks Databse.csv` (filename spelling is real) + Product Export:

- Custom Label = `{Pasting Mocks ID}-{UID}` (e.g. `M260-214332`)
- Fill **only** seed columns; skip if any cannot be filled
- Skip mock IDs already in the DB
- Gender Apparel = `{Brand Code} {Description}` (flatten `Men's` → `Mens`); no `™` / `&` in seed cols
- Then `fill_from_seeds.py` for the rest

Script defaults may still name old `ProductExport.xlsx` / `14-01-Mocks Database Guide(…).csv`. Pass current `support/` CSV paths if those 404. Dry-run first.
